[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5459267398","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122954#issuecomment-5459267398","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122954","id":5459267398,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRWXPRg","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-29T00:45:16Z","updated_at":"2026-08-29T00:45:16Z","body":"For comparison, this behavior is specific to the 8-bit `R8G8_UNORM` mapping.\n\nOther two-channel formats such as `DATA_FORMAT_R16G16_SFLOAT` and `DATA_FORMAT_R32G32_SFLOAT` use the natural `(R, G, 0, 1)` swizzle:\n\n- `R8G8_UNORM` → `LA8` → `(R, R, R, G)`\n- `R16G16_SFLOAT` → `RGH` → `(R, G, 0, 1)`\n- `R32G32_SFLOAT` → `RGF` → `(R, G, 0, 1)`\n\nSo with `R16G16_SFLOAT` or `R32G32_SFLOAT`, the second physical channel is accessible through `.g` as expected. Only `R8G8_UNORM` is forced to use the legacy luminance-alpha interpretation, with no way to select the corresponding `RG8` interpretation.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5459267398/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]